<title>FINLAND: Finnish April export prices fall 5.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish April export prices fall 5.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 5.1 percent year-on-year in April and they rose 0.6 percent month-on-month, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Monday.  </p>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated import prices fell 1.2 percent year-on-year in April and they fell 0.3 percent month-on-month, SF said.  </p>
<p>Export prices</p>
<p>		 April 1997     March 1997     April 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     +0.6 pct	   -0.4 pct	 -0.6 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 -5.1 pct	   -6.2 pct	 +4.5 pct</p>
<p>Import prices</p>
<p>		 April 1997     March 1997     April 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     -0.3 pct	   -0.2 pct	 +1.5 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 -1.2 pct	   +0.6 pct	 +1.9 pct</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
